    "text": "<p>Match List - I with List - II.</p><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"1\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"width: 500px;\">\t<tbody>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-I</strong></td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</td>\t\t\t<td style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>List-II</strong></td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>A</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/f5cca91a-5e09-4c04-acca-7af7b47cf026-image.png\" style=\"width: 205px; height: 102px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>I</td>\t\t\t<td>Dishwashing powder</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>B</td>\t\t\t<td><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/5e740000-c816-4b4a-ad0f-134ca9eb1ecf-image.png\" style=\"width: 280px; height: 72px;\" /></td>\t\t\t<td>II</td>\t\t\t<td>Toothpaste</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>C</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mn>17</mn></msub><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mn>35</mn></msub><msup><mi>COO</mi><mo>-</mo></msup><msup><mi>Na</mi><mo>+</mo></msup><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>Na</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CO</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo></math> Rosinate</td>\t\t\t<td>III</td>\t\t\t<td>Laundry soap</td>\t\t</tr>\t\t<tr>\t\t\t<td>D</td>\t\t\t<td><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>3</mn></msub><msub><mfenced><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mfenced><mn>16</mn></msub><mi>COO</mi><msub><mfenced><mrow><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>CH</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mi>OH</mi></math></td>\t\t\t<td>IV</td>\t\t\t<td>Hair conditioner</td>\t\t</tr>\t</tbody></table><p>Choose the correct answer from the options given below</p>",
